OL,3,GNEWSAMan's journey from brain injury to
OL,4,Astand-up comedy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was once told he might never
OL,7,Fwalk or talk again following a
OL,8,Fdevastating brain injury says stand-up
OL,9,Fcomedy has become the key to his
OL,10,Frecovery.
OL,12,FBen Shelvin was hospitalised after a
OL,13,Fdrunk driver crashed into his moped
OL,14,Fduring a family holiday to Croatia back
OL,15,Fin 2003.
OL,17,FNow aged 44, Shelvin, from Salford, has
OL,18,Fmade a near complete recovery, and has
OL,19,Fgone on to carve out a career
OL,20,Fperforming stand-up comedy, and even
OL,21,Frun half-marathons.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
