OL,3,GNEWSAMan's journey from brain injury to
OL,4,Astand-up comedy
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe described the road to recovery as "a
OL,7,Flong process" but said the best advice
OL,8,Fhe had to offer was to "just keep
OL,9,Fgoing".
